{"seq":3,"slug":"thompson-sampling","title":"汤普森采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/multi-armed-bandits-online/algorithms/thompson-sampling","wordCount":1637,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"汤普森采样\">汤普森采样</h1><p>1933 年，William Thompson 为了解决临床试验里「该把更多病人分给哪种疗法」的难题，提出了一个出奇简单的想法：为每种疗法维护一个「它有多好」的概率信念，每次决策时从这些信念里各抽一个样本，谁抽得高就选谁。这个算法沉睡了大半个世纪，直到 2010 年代被实证研究重新发掘——人们惊讶地发现，这个九十年前的老办法在很多场景下击败了精心设计的 <a href=\"ucb-confidence\">UCB</a>。今天它是工业界部署最广的老虎机算法之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>汤普森采样（Thompson Sampling，又称后验采样、概率匹配）是贝叶斯式的：它不维护单个点估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mu}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而是维护每个臂真实奖励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>后验分布</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>数据</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\mu_a \\mid \\text{数据})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。每一轮的决策分三步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>采样</strong>：从每个臂的后验分布中各抽一个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>数据</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\mu}_a \\sim P(\\mu_a \\mid \\text{数据})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>选择</strong>：选样本最大的臂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t = \\arg\\max_a \\tilde{\\mu}_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>更新</strong>：拉该臂、观测奖励，用贝叶斯法则更新它的后验。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对最常见的伯努利奖励（点击 / 不点击），用 Beta 分布作为共轭先验最为方便。臂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的后验是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Beta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Beta}(\\alpha_a, \\beta_a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Beta</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>成功次数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_a = 1 + (\\text{成功次数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成功次数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>失败次数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_a = 1 + (\\text{失败次数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">失败次数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（先验取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Beta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Beta}(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Beta</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 即均匀分布）。Beta-伯努利共轭让更新只是「成功 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 加一、失败 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 加一」，简单到极致。其贝叶斯机理参见 <a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/foundations/priors-likelihood\">先验与似然</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[每个臂 a 维护后验 Beta αa βa] --&gt; B[第 t 轮: 从每个后验各抽一个样本 μ̃a]&#10;  B --&gt; C[选样本最大的臂 a_t]&#10;  C --&gt; D[拉臂, 观测奖励 r ∈ 0/1]&#10;  D --&gt; E{r == 1?}&#10;  E --&gt;|成功| F[αa ← αa + 1]&#10;  E --&gt;|失败| G[βa ← βa + 1]&#10;  F --&gt; H[后验变窄, 不确定性下降]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[每个臂 a 维护后验 Beta αa βa] --&gt; B[第 t 轮: 从每个后验各抽一个样本 μ̃a]\n  B --&gt; C[选样本最大的臂 a_t]\n  C --&gt; D[拉臂, 观测奖励 r ∈ 0/1]\n  D --&gt; E{r == 1?}\n  E --&gt;|成功| F[αa ← αa + 1]\n  E --&gt;|失败| G[βa ← βa + 1]\n  F --&gt; H[后验变窄, 不确定性下降]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; A</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import random&#10;&#10;class ThompsonBernoulli:&#10;    def __init__(self, k):&#10;        self.alpha = [1.0] * k   # 先验 Beta(1,1)&#10;        self.beta = [1.0] * k&#10;&#10;    def select(self):&#10;        samples = [random.betavariate(self.alpha[a], self.beta[a])&#10;                   for a in range(len(self.alpha))]&#10;        return samples.index(max(samples))   # 选采样值最大的臂&#10;&#10;    def update(self, a, reward):&#10;        if reward == 1:&#10;            self.alpha[a] += 1&#10;        else:&#10;            self.beta[a] += 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThompsonBernoulli</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, k):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 先验 Beta(1,1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        samples </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [random.betavariate(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha[a], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta[a])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                   for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha))]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> samples.index(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(samples))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 选采样值最大的臂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, a, reward):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reward </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha[a] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta[a] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"为什么随机采样反而探索得更好\">为什么随机采样反而探索得更好</h2><p>汤普森采样的探索机制是「自动概率匹配」：一个臂被选中的概率，恰好等于「它在当前信念下真的是最优臂」的后验概率。这句话值得细品。</p>\n<p>一个臂如果数据少、后验很宽，那么它的采样值时高时低，偶尔会抽出一个很大的值而被选中——这就是探索，且探索程度与不确定性成正比，自动发生，无需像 <a href=\"epsilon-greedy\">ε-贪心</a> 那样手设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，也无需像 UCB 那样显式算置信半径。一个臂如果数据多、后验很窄，采样值稳定贴近真值：若真好则稳被选中（利用），若真差则稳被淘汰。随着数据积累，所有后验收窄，采样退化为近乎确定地选最优臂——探索自然退潮。</p>\n<p>与 UCB 的关键区别在于：UCB 用确定性的「最乐观上界」做探索，汤普森用随机采样的方式让每个臂按其「可能是最优」的概率被选中。后者的随机性带来两个实际好处。其一，它天然打散并发请求：成百上千个服务实例同时采样，会自然分散到不同臂，不会像确定性 UCB 那样在某一瞬间一窝蜂涌向同一个臂。其二，随机化使它在 <a href=\"../contextual/adversarial-bandits\">对抗 bandit</a> 那类不能让对手预测决策的环境里更稳健。</p>\n<p>理论上，汤普森采样同样达到对数遗憾 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，匹配 <a href=\"../foundations/regret-framework\">遗憾框架</a> 的下界阶数；而在有限样本的实证对比中，它经常以更低的常数因子优于 UCB——尤其在早期、数据稀疏时，贝叶斯先验提供了更好的校准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超越伯努利-不同奖励用不同共轭\">超越伯努利：不同奖励用不同共轭</h2><p>伯努利只是起点。奖励分布不同，换对应的共轭先验即可，算法骨架不变。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>奖励类型</th>\n<th>似然</th>\n<th>共轭先验</th>\n<th>后验更新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点击 / 转化（0-1）</td>\n<td>伯努利</td>\n<td>Beta</td>\n<td>成功 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha{+}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，失败 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta{+}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续值（如时长、金额）</td>\n<td>高斯（已知方差）</td>\n<td>高斯</td>\n<td>共轭高斯更新均值/方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数（如访问次数）</td>\n<td>泊松</td>\n<td>Gamma</td>\n<td>按观测累加形状/尺度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多类反馈</td>\n<td>多项</td>\n<td>Dirichlet</td>\n<td>对应类别计数加一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当奖励是连续的（如观看时长、客单价），常用高斯-高斯共轭或先把奖励归一化再套 Beta。当后验没有解析形式（如奖励是上下文特征的复杂函数），就用近似：从后验采样退化为「在参数上加噪声再贪心」，这正是把汤普森思想推广到上下文场景的桥梁，见 <a href=\"../contextual/linear-bandits\">线性 bandit (LinUCB)</a> 里的线性汤普森采样，以及更现代的神经网络变体。2024-2025 年的研究（如 Feel-Good Thompson Sampling、带噪声上下文的信息论遗憾分析）正活跃在如何让汤普森采样在复杂、含噪上下文下保持理论保证这一前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战中的细节\">实战中的细节</h2><p>汤普森采样上线时有几处值得注意。<strong>先验选择</strong>：信息量大的先验能加速冷启动但若设错会引入偏差，无把握时用弱先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Beta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Beta}(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Beta</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 最稳。<strong>奖励延迟</strong>：实际中点击反馈往往延迟数秒到数小时才回流，更新滞后会让采样基于过时后验，需要妥善处理，详见 <a href=\"../practice/bandits-in-practice\">落地与陷阱</a>。<strong>非平稳</strong>：标准更新把远古和最近的数据一视同仁，环境漂移时应对旧观测做指数折扣，让后验「适当遗忘」。<strong>状态持久化</strong>：每个臂的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\alpha,\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 必须在多实例间一致地原子更新（常存于 Redis 等共享存储），否则并发会导致更新丢失。</p>\n<p>总的来说，汤普森采样在「实现简洁、实证表现、并发友好」三项上常是最佳综合选择，这也是它在现代推荐、广告、乃至大模型变体在线选择中被广泛采用的原因；它与 <a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/bayesian-ab-testing\">贝叶斯 AB 测试</a> 共享同一套后验推断语言，理解其一有助于理解另一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>汤普森采样为每个臂维护奖励的后验分布，每轮从各后验采样、选样本最大者、再贝叶斯更新。</li>\n<li>伯努利奖励用 Beta-伯努利共轭，更新仅是「成功 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha{+}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、失败 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta{+}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>」，简单到极致。</li>\n<li>探索是自动概率匹配：选臂概率等于其「真为最优」的后验概率，探索强度随不确定性自适应、随数据积累退潮。</li>\n<li>相比 UCB 的确定性乐观，其随机采样天然打散并发、对对手环境更稳健，实证常以更低常数因子取胜。</li>\n<li>换共轭先验即可处理高斯/泊松/多项奖励；先验、延迟、非平稳、状态持久化是上线四个关键细节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"ucb-confidence\">UCB 置信上界</a>、<a href=\"../contextual/linear-bandits\">线性 bandit (LinUCB)</a>、<a href=\"../practice/bandits-in-practice\">落地与陷阱</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/foundations/priors-likelihood\">贝叶斯数据分析 · 先验与似然</a>、<a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/bayesian-ab-testing\">AB 测试与统计 · 贝叶斯 AB 测试</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"汤普森采样","id":"汤普森采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么随机采样反而探索得更好","id":"为什么随机采样反而探索得更好"},{"level":2,"text":"超越伯努利：不同奖励用不同共轭","id":"超越伯努利-不同奖励用不同共轭"},{"level":2,"text":"实战中的细节","id":"实战中的细节"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"UCB 置信上界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/multi-armed-bandits-online/algorithms/ucb-confidence"},"next":{"title":"上下文 bandit","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/multi-armed-bandits-online/contextual/contextual-bandits"}}